<title>USA: Del Laboratories Inc Q4 Dec 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Del Laboratories Inc Q4 Dec 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGDALE, N.Y. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
